{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmh8j6zvadc0","created":1793268227922,"text":"支持向量机"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8ji47mq00","created":1793268252129,"text":"间隔与支持向量"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8jm64g6o0","created":1793268260952,"text":"划分超平面"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8ljiji5k0","created":1793268411900,"text":"一个低一维的函数，用于划分空间的样本"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8jqaa36g0","created":1793268269910,"text":"样本到超平面距离"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8m2883d40","created":1793268452635,"text":"样本在空间到函数的距离"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8jthugf40","created":1793268276898,"text":"支持向量"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8l593p940","created":1793268380855,"text":"距离超平面最近的样本点"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8jw2qfeo0","created":1793268282514,"text":"间隔"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8kx5hgig0","created":1793268363222,"text":"两个异类支持向量之间的距离"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8k0v0ykg0","created":1793268292932,"text":"硬间隔SVM优化目标"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8kac1yl40","created":1793268313553,"text":"含义"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8kfpefdc0","created":1793268325244,"text":"找到超平面，最大化间隔，要求所有样本全部正确分类，没有错分。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8kcw6mo80","created":1793268319124,"text":"前提"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8ki1kbsg0","created":1793268330333,"text":"数据线性可分。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8mmxkj9k0","created":1793268497704,"text":"对偶问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8nhdy5yw0","created":1793268563998,"text":"含义"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8noq1in40","created":1793268579966,"text":"对偶就是把原来的优化问题（原问题），转换成另一个等价的优化问题（对偶问题），两个问题最优解是对应的，但是变量、约束形式变了。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8nvydse80","created":1793268595708,"text":"KKT 条件"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8pf0n7080","created":1793268715568,"text":"乘子非负"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8pi1pqm00","created":1793268722163,"text":"约束满足"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8pktd8dk0","created":1793268728188,"text":"互补松弛"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8ppdj2mo0","created":1793268738115,"text":"目的"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8q5j4now0","created":1793268773282,"text":"更容易求解"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8q5j4zt40","created":1793268773282,"text":"目标里只有内积，自然引出核函数，处理非线性问题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8qkp0f4w0","created":1793268806289,"text":"SMO 算法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8qoqa7zk0","created":1793268815073,"text":"高效求解对偶问题。每次只选两个变量 αi,αj 优化，固定其余参数，不断迭代直到收敛"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8r0ysb7s0","created":1793268841709,"text":"核函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh8r4bghtk0","created":1793268849005,"text":"核函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh8r707xp40","created":1793268854856,"text":"核函数定义"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}